		{"id":"8a841808cc3c1c5d","x":-411,"y":-346,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"[[Armount.canvas]]\n#Volstarian_Dynasty "},
		{"id":"6cb70871b9d06a20","x":-411,"y":-260,"width":545,"height":250,"type":"text","text":"A small slit in the ice just large enough for someone to fit in leads into a chamber of ice. In this area there are old remnants of camps and some dead bodies. A few of the campsites are decades to hundreds of years old however there is one that seems to be hobbled together and newly made with very recent signs of life.\n\nWithin this large rectangular chamber there is only the entrance you came from and small doorway with a metal door hanging off its hinges wide opened.\n"}
	],
